diff --git a/ChangeLog b/ChangeLog
index b6ba4be..0d4a90d 100644
--- a/ChangeLog
+++ b/ChangeLog
@@ -33,6 +33,11 @@ Release date: TBA
 
   closes #5722
 
+* Fix the ``--notes`` option so that note tags made up entirely of punctuation
+  characters (e.g. ``???``) are detected.
+
+  Closes #5858
+
 * Fixed crash from ``arguments-differ`` and ``arguments-renamed`` when methods were
   defined outside the top level of a class.
 
